{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":1,"case_id":"RC96-CH01-02","source_id":"LC6-CH01","source_title":"开市前修好那排棚","source_genre":"现代职场／市井维修","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH01_现代市井_第一章_开市前修好那排棚.md","source_chapter_sha256":"fdaad63f91f7f49a57794633b5dba99aa365607f6096f305472889d599db7d29","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1720,"target_end":1875,"target_sha256":"2e61d1beb8cef616195dc759bdbaa1c50ef0b1a1430e4dfa573febed359709a8","target_non_whitespace_character_count":151,"review_class":"FACT_4","reviewed_fact_count":4,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":28,"text":"桥下的老何七点四十五送来两根可调支柱，只收押金，不肯卖。","text_sha256":"b7eb4fb85fff195e84638de80fafbdc3c746cef609a0cc6a9b41d7655ec45a5d"},{"id":"T02","start":28,"end":59,"text":"他说方管随便切，支柱不能留下，下午还有婚庆公司借去搭灯架。\n\n","text_sha256":"97d239ad5bd6bc3a6e464c50a050473ffb5e0cf2318db37ac3ac8a2ada0253cd"},{"id":"T03","start":59,"end":87,"text":"周遥检查底座和锁销，在支点下面垫了厚木板，亲手拧紧两轮。","text_sha256":"af1bf2a3ec605b03b58fd323a6d3c4bf8c584a713766cb7ca9b8b3455804305c"},{"id":"T04","start":87,"end":112,"text":"临撑立起后，她让所有人退出去，再用长杆压篷边试力。","text_sha256":"1e32cd036a229dc72e8bd5254057c5832f5756cf62cbfa54450f151b81035a6d"},{"id":"T05","start":112,"end":151,"text":"横梁没再下沉，断口却发出很轻的一声刮响。\n\n“只能当临时通道，不能在下面囤货。","text_sha256":"80d4ea300b0ab82f1f399110a2a9cd318dc4139181976080b865822d0e43b34b"},{"id":"T06","start":151,"end":155,"text":"”她说。","text_sha256":"66281816cfac24388df91eac34db6866f987ece607bff593ac3b7f646314183a"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":2,"case_id":"RC96-CH02-01","source_id":"LC6-CH02","source_title":"平码不认人情","source_genre":"古代商贸","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH02_古代商贸_第二章_平码不认人情.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a9f8121456289469e437755ef0b95798e4aa16e4dd104f3467ac98ce8c203b57","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":701,"target_end":854,"target_sha256":"528b904f8c6ea64d2c45abde29d512ed32692474085cd7051e126c75e666c2e5","target_non_whitespace_character_count":151,"review_class":"HARD_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":36,"text":"这场争执一散，院子忽然活了。车轮碾过青砖，绳索勒进货筐，伙计们把麻、豆、","text_sha256":"ccb876ec1e77ede35459903c8de1f893a1aaaffb70425f9bc1165365311ac97e"},{"id":"T02","start":36,"end":76,"text":"桐油分到三条道。有人嫌阿谷写牌慢，自己拿炭笔往筐上画；有人为抢阴凉把车横了半边；","text_sha256":"9a9d831bfe1da51aee327a86de86484f5589d24aafe35a36c147b32536437b1c"},{"id":"T03","start":76,"end":115,"text":"一只装在竹笼里的鹅伸长脖子，接连啄走桌角两张废票，主人追着它绕了秤台一圈。\n\n","text_sha256":"da03a7abad5566659eec7f24ab229a789f62eea2c5b181ac98cc0c7a0c479c43"},{"id":"T04","start":115,"end":153,"text":"沈绫坐到檐下擦铜砣。阿谷端来冷茶，杯沿磕掉一小块瓷，她换了个方向才没碰到嘴。","text_sha256":"e300313b0652d604d26155e4ff5ee3f469c291c658aae0356c5780ee4bd3cb7f"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":3,"case_id":"RC96-CH03-03","source_id":"LC6-CH03","source_title":"一桌席不能少那口锅","source_genre":"乡村家庭","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH03_乡村家庭_第三章_一桌席不能少那口锅.md","source_chapter_sha256":"7e14d3edde53968627b42d92017389d6b3fdb797887baa1589cded954fbe36f0","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1289,"target_end":1404,"target_sha256":"b37013446eb7a77af9e8214d51407fc88c9e84b711a7cfaba43f12bcdc1bf509","target_non_whitespace_character_count":113,"review_class":"FACT_5","reviewed_fact_count":5,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":31,"text":"蒸笼解决后，桌数还悬着。林慧重新数名单，确定明天至少五十八人；","text_sha256":"c5a4135f460ad73e78d93023f7a37ea069e8a682ff9fdf6989dd7d3969243f93"},{"id":"T02","start":31,"end":69,"text":"家里现有六张圆桌，只能坐四十八人。\n\n村委会仓库有折叠桌，但钥匙在会计那里，","text_sha256":"76c4c096fb395d8ed4f1e1cfc6e40dce99a499cc65a5d07fd10fd952e176f2a9"},{"id":"T03","start":69,"end":99,"text":"会计今天去了镇上。父亲提议让年轻人晚一轮吃，老太太立即反对，","text_sha256":"e66060b16cacdca7e51608578c1e79d071541c4a029021f0881d3732e8ce0742"},{"id":"T04","start":99,"end":115,"text":"说来祝寿的人没有站着等饭的道理。","text_sha256":"6786844e7605dfc390a4454fe95c429269ba2db879d1d7675230897d92a5ed84"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":4,"case_id":"RC96-CH04-03","source_id":"LC6-CH04","source_title":"第四棒不追风","source_genre":"青春竞技","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH04_青春竞技_第四章_第四棒不追风.md","source_chapter_sha256":"e4633301da8d805dbcddea9c8022046254f468bb58b0ba3f016b039039eefe69","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1361,"target_end":1468,"target_sha256":"804b2a9416ff5089859cb6ae9f3bafef1582040cdb14d105b70134382d66cf07","target_non_whitespace_character_count":103,"review_class":"FACT_1","reviewed_fact_count":1,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":40,"text":"操场广播换了一首快歌。许乔跟着副歌拍两下手，杜航嫌她拍错节奏，自己示范也没对上。","text_sha256":"d74bf31b17035f7d62a7b8ce30ee8e74e955429a0948f127b1bb3b7f8ec41d60"},{"id":"T02","start":40,"end":67,"text":"\n\n孟秋把接力棒竖在鼻尖试平衡，棒子刚立住便倒进草里。","text_sha256":"ebcaf082313fccb84251a19e15a2c2da399a26f7b0a872ce46b35adb46305e85"},{"id":"T03","start":67,"end":107,"text":"那几分钟谁都没有作新决定，紧绷的肩膀却慢慢松了些。\n\n十分钟过去，贺宁仍没出现。","text_sha256":"db0d3787f8bb2465676f142c4e8a7f843b401dce35e25d11d6d32cf8bbe0be6b"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":5,"case_id":"RC96-CH06-01","source_id":"LC6-CH06","source_title":"风廊降温失败以后","source_genre":"近未来公共设施","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH06_近未来公共设施_第六章_风廊降温失败以后.md","source_chapter_sha256":"85ce23e513bf972953c6703ef15230b6b629de9f5df044ef16aec30977f1df5b","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":889,"target_end":1005,"target_sha256":"4817c06fc4a652f4c2b165712fb9ed37a0cc8e39805363b9ebadd91e1807b2e7","target_non_whitespace_character_count":114,"review_class":"FACT_5","reviewed_fact_count":5,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":21,"text":"五号风口没有热风，只有几乎感觉不到的弱风。","text_sha256":"14622c4c969ccd9f861ea6311087c67b12a5364b5260849e9c18afbafb1401fa"},{"id":"T02","start":21,"end":51,"text":"柏青测了三次，温度都比其他风口高四度，说明屏幕没有冤枉设备。","text_sha256":"96940cc6e1b20992b338aad633bed6a18107148debb9cc15fc7c074a26848856"},{"id":"T03","start":51,"end":77,"text":"检修口里传来均匀的嗡声，叶轮在转，进风量却不足。\n\n","text_sha256":"8642c5d2b6fce4e49a3d6c01b8e0530c64b12c63f813bf40a3d3f7c0284a663e"},{"id":"T04","start":77,"end":116,"text":"柏青判断过滤格可能在早晨施工时装反。他准备停掉整条风廊十分钟，拆开五号进风箱。","text_sha256":"e8bc451bc8087efa8b887eb240d08d7826569cf5358918a6a96b3265b7bbd0b5"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":6,"case_id":"RC96-CH08-01","source_id":"LC6-CH08","source_title":"云灶今日不卖飞升饼","source_genre":"轻幻想／仙侠日常","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH08_轻幻想日常_第八章_云灶今日不卖飞升饼.md","source_chapter_sha256":"ec940b1ee92f1784bc0fa6036b9b4aa99c8d2c3f808f787c7a0df940ae2572f2","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":17,"target_end":192,"target_sha256":"5f505871d5f897e014126be39c136be2332ec6d9302f1493589df639660e1d8c","target_non_whitespace_character_count":171,"review_class":"FACT_2","reviewed_fact_count":2,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":31,"text":"卯时刚过，青萝峰的云灶房便贴出了一张告示：今日不卖飞升饼。\n\n","text_sha256":"779d340589920f7a7f7eac9219a65664a0084d10aa82695dfab4437a20c35f77"},{"id":"T02","start":31,"end":63,"text":"告示是伙房管事郑七娘写的。她怕弟子们看不明白，还在下面补了一行：","text_sha256":"3d625dd077e287de131a520b00e254d4a8556fa9d2e7b47cd308c9755de0ecd7"},{"id":"T03","start":63,"end":86,"text":"昨日吃饼后御剑变快，纯属顺风，莫来问配方。\n\n","text_sha256":"5468abfb426556dea33e39fcb88e636f923d9c97c523d6242456a0cced6bfb7e"},{"id":"T04","start":86,"end":111,"text":"岑小满拎着两筐灵薯进门时，告示前已经围了十几个人。","text_sha256":"b53c94ac89f1cad6a2194a2a5541a49f83b8eb832cdfcf463ba9d44cddbef135"},{"id":"T05","start":111,"end":147,"text":"有人认真回忆昨天风从哪边吹，有人声称自己吃了两张饼后连上三层台阶都不喘，","text_sha256":"d6f14b5d4d399f575e7731ad518452c3b4e61a28e564c57d3271a525b3c384b3"},{"id":"T06","start":147,"end":175,"text":"还有个新弟子问，若只买饼边，会不会便宜一点、飞得慢一点。","text_sha256":"74670f2cf9dcac7233ccac4ac1062e866e157f2e68790ba0738400780c219cf1"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":7,"case_id":"RC96-CH02-02","source_id":"LC6-CH02","source_title":"平码不认人情","source_genre":"古代商贸","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH02_古代商贸_第二章_平码不认人情.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a9f8121456289469e437755ef0b95798e4aa16e4dd104f3467ac98ce8c203b57","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1138,"target_end":1308,"target_sha256":"9b91e4bc64ffe37b021ec29a89d206c2295870138b363902ad25fd68663b1dd4","target_non_whitespace_character_count":164,"review_class":"FACT_6","reviewed_fact_count":6,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":37,"text":"午前，东平码行的杜二爷带人抬来四箱胡椒。箱上都盖着水运帮的火漆，封口齐整，","text_sha256":"a243b9e7d0436db752666bd6141fdb5373de9c76963ff806fc6fcc68ba0c17af"},{"id":"T02","start":37,"end":71,"text":"报单却只写了三箱。杜二爷说第四箱是路上临时并来的样货，不入今日大账，","text_sha256":"14cea75fcea36ec78868477a3ea812618c0d449189c930cffdc8c231e9840d80"},{"id":"T03","start":71,"end":101,"text":"只需借沈家的秤过一下数。\n\n沈绫没有开秤：“平码行可以验重，","text_sha256":"9b15b1a83d2352557e172c90542f75b2c7ccd25574188e71d9073ab14707e7dc"},{"id":"T04","start":101,"end":135,"text":"不能替没有来历的货补身份。”\n\n“我不让你补文书，只借一杆秤。”\n\n","text_sha256":"89d9480a90bbf7090cee4ba1cb97fb0b31790fd2e77fa6cece037539056757e7"},{"id":"T05","start":135,"end":170,"text":"“秤出的数会进今日平码簿。簿上有箱、报单上没箱，到了关口，问的是我。”","text_sha256":"f83e70b828d69aa6cd661212efe58866f45bb0f927732e649b61ce9933219a57"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":8,"case_id":"RC96-CH03-01","source_id":"LC6-CH03","source_title":"一桌席不能少那口锅","source_genre":"乡村家庭","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH03_乡村家庭_第三章_一桌席不能少那口锅.md","source_chapter_sha256":"7e14d3edde53968627b42d92017389d6b3fdb797887baa1589cded954fbe36f0","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":745,"target_end":852,"target_sha256":"727a7fe03f0bb3d4b8f2fbac59265bf1db9d35acec03807588baa7fb64d0087f","target_non_whitespace_character_count":105,"review_class":"NATURAL_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":30,"text":"小外孙拿枣当弹珠，在炕桌上滚来滚去。滚丢一颗，他趴到柜脚找；","text_sha256":"0387c1ac44bac93c7dad71c6a93fbd92ba273cec671bd3eac111d34dbb79e1aa"},{"id":"T02","start":30,"end":65,"text":"找到后吹两下，塞回外婆手边。\n\n老太太故意又滚一颗，他咯咯笑着再去捡。","text_sha256":"6290b4d1a3ab197e4021584dbbf531ad83752e5c32de3b849449c9710fef905e"},{"id":"T03","start":65,"end":96,"text":"堂屋里的人说着柴够不够、鸡杀几只、谁去接三姑，话一阵密一阵疏，","text_sha256":"dc700e2093467ec5e127ae612f8144cdd713e64080ed8378ca9dbd0eb6fef08a"},{"id":"T04","start":96,"end":107,"text":"没有哪一句真落成决定。","text_sha256":"34d00ccac122d23328280ce7c3947fd4e88222b591deb3bdbc6756b784df0cbd"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":9,"case_id":"RC96-CH04-04","source_id":"LC6-CH04","source_title":"第四棒不追风","source_genre":"青春竞技","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH04_青春竞技_第四章_第四棒不追风.md","source_chapter_sha256":"e4633301da8d805dbcddea9c8022046254f468bb58b0ba3f016b039039eefe69","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2114,"target_end":2231,"target_sha256":"5a29c6d4769cd4703224db641dab710edfa4b4745df5a79570c76c9fd2b2a429","target_non_whitespace_character_count":115,"review_class":"FACT_6","reviewed_fact_count":6,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":32,"text":"检录还剩七分钟。四班保留原名单，不启用孟秋，也不叫唐梨离岗。\n\n","text_sha256":"e6cea1e0259db05b7ebccab5c1dd4e01ac15f41b0470c7b6b90e8081b9962df2"},{"id":"T02","start":32,"end":62,"text":"棒次却需要调整：贺宁手掌磨破，第四棒全程握棒且交接风险最大；","text_sha256":"7f344d7b0521f45f9f64de0ac37c093e23e63765f64a253d4a129f7437ef356e"},{"id":"T03","start":62,"end":93,"text":"许乔愿意从第二棒换到第四棒，贺宁改跑第二棒，只接一次、交一次。","text_sha256":"fb4b8e7530f048dd37ac96363a2b99145291665035bcce82142265d20845b8ff"},{"id":"T04","start":93,"end":117,"text":"杜航第一，唐梨继续广播，原第三棒宋晓按计划上场。","text_sha256":"e54760a00881274d3b398ab1371540d338caecee7c0d7d3ded983a674d604ae0"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":10,"case_id":"RC96-CH06-02","source_id":"LC6-CH06","source_title":"风廊降温失败以后","source_genre":"近未来公共设施","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH06_近未来公共设施_第六章_风廊降温失败以后.md","source_chapter_sha256":"85ce23e513bf972953c6703ef15230b6b629de9f5df044ef16aec30977f1df5b","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1471,"target_end":1701,"target_sha256":"eb735ec58ce3e8f41bf291ab030314a8dc039cddcb64d462d46d1a7e7a4d0119","target_non_whitespace_character_count":224,"review_class":"FACT_1","reviewed_fact_count":1,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":33,"text":"人群慢慢散开。小学生把剩下的纸杯叠成塔，被食堂阿姨一只只拿去回收；","text_sha256":"149b9d3617ec405c8e416b6881b948f82fd583ffbe3cc14cdfedc61ed77028ec"},{"id":"T02","start":33,"end":56,"text":"灰帽老人喝完绿豆水，碗底留着两颗没化开的糖粒；","text_sha256":"932719a5bda70b6122d73b9969ea6d04d492bbb7a8b9e3f235f0942ae523468a"},{"id":"T03","start":56,"end":91,"text":"冯护士帮另一位老人找到布袋，又发现她其实一直把手伸在袋里捏着扇子。\n\n","text_sha256":"d32f7dc305473f97dbe69d1b78fc0a26dff909a736ea9bfe0354b75b35427e46"},{"id":"T04","start":91,"end":129,"text":"柏青坐到长椅边擦工具。他把六枚螺丝按大小排开，清点两遍，又发现手套压住一枚，","text_sha256":"64cf8f0aca0fe5ae0d1f33ecaf80d2b0a35368acaf851411ea6e8cf517b861d0"},{"id":"T05","start":129,"end":157,"text":"只好从头数。\n\n施工队长借来抹布，把检修口边缘的灰擦净。","text_sha256":"ab4d65b5300a1b6b1b289d77e41885fd55b56273ae3b6210fbebea34a1a4509f"},{"id":"T06","start":157,"end":191,"text":"老赵推着锥桶沿路收回，走三步停一下，把底座里的沙倒回同一只袋里。\n\n","text_sha256":"cddc63796071a8f952e348c698cefd72f4a105f2ed5c777b25d66bf00c80d881"},{"id":"T07","start":191,"end":230,"text":"一阵真正的凉风从五号口吹来，掀动众人的衣角。有人鼓掌，灰帽老人也跟着拍了两下。","text_sha256":"47d2568c7fb876ff94da8611bd0e9caba7fa9e05380dcea4fa07dc9aae54d5da"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":11,"case_id":"RC96-CH08-02","source_id":"LC6-CH08","source_title":"云灶今日不卖飞升饼","source_genre":"轻幻想／仙侠日常","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH08_轻幻想日常_第八章_云灶今日不卖飞升饼.md","source_chapter_sha256":"ec940b1ee92f1784bc0fa6036b9b4aa99c8d2c3f808f787c7a0df940ae2572f2","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":630,"target_end":860,"target_sha256":"4eedbe4e775a293f5cccda8b196f7add7d951d910a4439358d3c86c3546669ab","target_non_whitespace_character_count":224,"review_class":"HARD_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":40,"text":"事情安排完，灶房重新忙起来。豆子倒进石磨，磨盘转得慢，岑小满和槐生一人推半圈。\n","text_sha256":"dfe54e10a7626a7b324e816d652695d42286f7f6c2e78276efce17375e8d8781"},{"id":"T02","start":40,"end":69,"text":"\n第一圈槐生抢得快，木柄差点撞她手腕；第二圈两人换了节奏，","text_sha256":"ddada5ed4d742507c055de7fa36c91d75b58801da2f108854d7aa4af0075f807"},{"id":"T03","start":69,"end":109,"text":"推到同一位置便同时松手。豆浆从磨嘴流进木桶，泡沫鼓起，又被郑七娘用竹片轻轻刮走。","text_sha256":"7f9e2eeb9515f2c71a2e554ea9bda9d8470b9c63518fcd2ce4131d50f5684604"},{"id":"T04","start":109,"end":136,"text":"\n\n门外那群问飞升饼的人并没有真走远。他们隔着窗闻香，","text_sha256":"47714b91df4ebcfcc374400d58315476731d656540a3e92f124f3620abb77d86"},{"id":"T05","start":136,"end":163,"text":"猜今天豆羹里是不是也藏了秘诀。\n\n一个瘦高弟子举着碗，","text_sha256":"64093cc0b7d9591f407a100c54108542c990eed3ccbc143753bdc9f23c5a24b4"},{"id":"T06","start":163,"end":195,"text":"说昨日飞得快是因为自己新换了剑穗；旁边的人说剑穗是他上月就换的。","text_sha256":"478cc10326348680fc1d921559e82f7b3fd56f8c8ee3befc1a565d1ef66e9a8f"},{"id":"T07","start":195,"end":230,"text":"两人翻起旧账，从剑穗颜色争到谁欠谁三枚铜钱，最后被蒸汽熏得一起打喷嚏。","text_sha256":"166e83940f8fbd641f2dd5db0cda092b6038cd2d2ce4b8d8aff7a1a3c28b3083"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":12,"case_id":"RC96-CH01-03","source_id":"LC6-CH01","source_title":"开市前修好那排棚","source_genre":"现代职场／市井维修","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH01_现代市井_第一章_开市前修好那排棚.md","source_chapter_sha256":"fdaad63f91f7f49a57794633b5dba99aa365607f6096f305472889d599db7d29","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2300,"target_end":2427,"target_sha256":"608030cb6b99adc1d0a1212968eaf3566f4aebdbd9244de06dd926cace274b8f","target_non_whitespace_character_count":123,"review_class":"FACT_3","reviewed_fact_count":3,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":39,"text":"“不是今天全拆。”周遥把检测位置圈起来，“这一跨先加第二根支柱，下午清场后换。","text_sha256":"8247a33a34a4c66bcd432d7da4e16cbd148afb00a849e63d7f2efda6379d6a8a"},{"id":"T02","start":39,"end":79,"text":"菜场照开，但西侧今晚提前一小时收摊。”\n\n徐阿姨皱眉：“谁去通知夜市那几家？”\n","text_sha256":"ea3e3429037900732f5085d5d3e98ca2cb66cfd9598a2a6ce7a7f9b935050977"},{"id":"T03","start":79,"end":115,"text":"\n陈放已经拿起处置单：“我去。也把临撑押金、北仓用料和下午施工一起写清，","text_sha256":"078822d480f23d7d5788814618c21204068d6aaa0aa2a4fe87ac55db84bb28f5"},{"id":"T04","start":115,"end":127,"text":"省得晚上又说没人知道。”","text_sha256":"a0274869ec69786fa4e4a878fd74096bef1d12425d4c04c3227ee2e176062d6d"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":13,"case_id":"RC96-CH03-04","source_id":"LC6-CH03","source_title":"一桌席不能少那口锅","source_genre":"乡村家庭","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH03_乡村家庭_第三章_一桌席不能少那口锅.md","source_chapter_sha256":"7e14d3edde53968627b42d92017389d6b3fdb797887baa1589cded954fbe36f0","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2192,"target_end":2318,"target_sha256":"8dc96b2155b6fd492e88153a81dc04ec4ef2a327ff6d7eda4a8cf3ffb671f0bb","target_non_whitespace_character_count":124,"review_class":"FACT_3","reviewed_fact_count":3,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":31,"text":"天快黑时，三姑打来电话，说自家实际只来五人，另外三人临时有事。","text_sha256":"e3d46c9c8eb00645cc0f009e1ffc1ccb514f5e4283a4f95d06b926d497ac579c"},{"id":"T02","start":31,"end":63,"text":"名单从五十九降回五十六。\n\n林慧拿橡皮擦掉三个名字，纸都擦薄了。","text_sha256":"180747358c97c7349783d24fa2150edd282264e96f2e00252456a4fc7d668e26"},{"id":"T03","start":63,"end":103,"text":"大伯建议把祠堂桌退一张，免得院里太挤；林满仓却决定两张都留，因为明早天气若转冷，","text_sha256":"7cf54137a5b27ff606ce4ef25993c62622f96c51b3b28d5f8c9403c537bfd570"},{"id":"T04","start":103,"end":126,"text":"菜要从院里移到堂屋，桌面可以临时放盘和保温桶。","text_sha256":"e1024103448978720649699bf25ef5c5447ba93250fd4ad72020efb523ac1d71"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":14,"case_id":"RC96-CH04-01","source_id":"LC6-CH04","source_title":"第四棒不追风","source_genre":"青春竞技","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH04_青春竞技_第四章_第四棒不追风.md","source_chapter_sha256":"e4633301da8d805dbcddea9c8022046254f468bb58b0ba3f016b039039eefe69","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":985,"target_end":1102,"target_sha256":"b980638280275bd879b1a723717d9e158da65cba1085cc21da7b015a183a1054","target_non_whitespace_character_count":115,"review_class":"HARD_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":35,"text":"杜航提议做两次慢速交棒。顾驰拿一根旧接力棒，四个人沿着草坪边排开。\n\n","text_sha256":"ad99ca9cb88f7ea95e5c435a328f430c9c542e117bacd1fe77d2a5042d460b7a"},{"id":"T02","start":35,"end":71,"text":"第一次，许乔提前伸手，棒头碰到她手腕；第二次，杜航起跑太快，只好回头接。","text_sha256":"9f1587792f51a09cff66eaa388d79ded67256002f4c2f079acfa77e2c8509e00"},{"id":"T03","start":71,"end":108,"text":"谁都没有计时，也没人谈贺宁。看台上有同学举着班旗经过，问他们是不是要退赛，","text_sha256":"899497284c1fda32026eac535e304145e1c6b898fc7132bd5bbcec9313544b1a"},{"id":"T04","start":108,"end":117,"text":"顾驰只说还在热身。","text_sha256":"c145d73c6b5bbf25f3184d4a4511e30d9a6bf99c813c14cb0c5ea2e2a095cd70"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":15,"case_id":"RC96-CH06-04","source_id":"LC6-CH06","source_title":"风廊降温失败以后","source_genre":"近未来公共设施","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH06_近未来公共设施_第六章_风廊降温失败以后.md","source_chapter_sha256":"85ce23e513bf972953c6703ef15230b6b629de9f5df044ef16aec30977f1df5b","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2229,"target_end":2407,"target_sha256":"2c035e20895594afcd8bb445356459203f0c3c97e7117aa3e1c4b37cb5c9b801","target_non_whitespace_character_count":174,"review_class":"FACT_3","reviewed_fact_count":3,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":38,"text":"一名家长不肯挪车，说自己只停两分钟。老赵解释坡道不能堵，对方指着后面一排车，","text_sha256":"5f003eb08886985494447322224f0b2bbd8f6608976e720cc12261fab242a86d"},{"id":"T02","start":38,"end":78,"text":"问为什么只叫他。\n\n林沅没有和他争先后，直接把无障碍接驳车正在转弯的画面指给他看","text_sha256":"26976de70c13169fd84e24431f5ae50d0139f359e8cd374f0cd7682ad46a5f4b"},{"id":"T03","start":78,"end":108,"text":"。车头已经被他的车挡住，车内一名坐轮椅的老人正等着下坡。\n\n","text_sha256":"9bbc8febe9ca3d96089600b80d2f9913590c75dc64bdaa1b45f44d102d9b8b00"},{"id":"T04","start":108,"end":133,"text":"家长看了一眼，终于启动车。后面三辆车也跟着往前挪。","text_sha256":"f035a939dde44411c0fd8c0eaf957405064a0661b414f4f1ed0dda7710bd58fc"},{"id":"T05","start":133,"end":163,"text":"接驳车进入坡道后，冯护士从车上下来，先确认两位老人都有座位，","text_sha256":"efedfea62bc7dfbcc631d6599fa55951f62f29264e4c72bfc2a09d05332bda81"},{"id":"T06","start":163,"end":178,"text":"再朝林沅比了一个可以走的手势。","text_sha256":"69c1e18e6e82492d77463eb391f22c645967c777f5404decb8826230e7bb50d6"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":16,"case_id":"RC96-CH08-04","source_id":"LC6-CH08","source_title":"云灶今日不卖飞升饼","source_genre":"轻幻想／仙侠日常","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH08_轻幻想日常_第八章_云灶今日不卖飞升饼.md","source_chapter_sha256":"ec940b1ee92f1784bc0fa6036b9b4aa99c8d2c3f808f787c7a0df940ae2572f2","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1595,"target_end":1701,"target_sha256":"0c6bf6f74d16817e22766c562bedb49a71bb8d6b1996a11059dd58d9c91d051d","target_non_whitespace_character_count":102,"review_class":"FACT_4","reviewed_fact_count":4,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":35,"text":"小锅里水声咕嘟。岑小满挑三只大小相近的灵薯，分别削皮、称重、切块。\n\n","text_sha256":"279ad68fb378f6e9e7c3683c599c1e717674cd44191909151e3390fc4f66cf9f"},{"id":"T02","start":35,"end":74,"text":"蓝芽遇热后颜色淡了，锅沿却凝出一圈薄霜。她用木勺搅动，霜随蒸汽一寸寸爬上勺柄，","text_sha256":"179a207ed40e1ddd3d153de2c902affc82444823257e8042f228b455c8f1ab22"},{"id":"T03","start":74,"end":106,"text":"灶下火焰反而低了。\n\n郑七娘皱眉：“月露灵薯会催火，不会压火。”","text_sha256":"cd171534c5e7eb94a4f746930e663a9cc58d3ad9dd9e31a60f1cc08f486ef19a"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":17,"case_id":"RC96-CH01-01","source_id":"LC6-CH01","source_title":"开市前修好那排棚","source_genre":"现代职场／市井维修","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH01_现代市井_第一章_开市前修好那排棚.md","source_chapter_sha256":"fdaad63f91f7f49a57794633b5dba99aa365607f6096f305472889d599db7d29","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1503,"target_end":1654,"target_sha256":"01bbf564c4c16c27da84eb8dfbf330cd3b852400a9c50718f233c65d3f64f974","target_non_whitespace_character_count":149,"review_class":"NATURAL_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":40,"text":"老魏把锥桶摆成弯道，一辆辆引进来。陈放站在车流边喊“慢”，声音起初被发动机盖住，","text_sha256":"4e142917696ff0f8fe5dd2ee23f1eef1806dbf8593a2d395fe4c3402d6a8a2e0"},{"id":"T02","start":40,"end":71,"text":"喊到第五辆时已经沙了。周遥从旧篷布上拆下绳扣，放进蓝色塑料盆；","text_sha256":"82d1be616b8cb79b5a50c6a85a8e5cc0aea2a88c81fe04a4b827c11ffd8d82dd"},{"id":"T03","start":71,"end":111,"text":"徐阿姨把泡沫箱摞成两列；马叔拿扫把赶开积水，又嫌扫把头太散，去借肉摊的硬毛刷。\n","text_sha256":"26b4a76aa055a4caba566501955983ca4d508b228f334a13d96951f3b6e991bf"},{"id":"T04","start":111,"end":151,"text":"\n一只橘猫从卷帘门底下钻进来，绕着盆闻了两圈。陈放用脚挡它，它转身蹭上老魏裤腿。","text_sha256":"86f0dac8af2f8d5c9ee79e5cb33526d4470002916102de6b18003c43684f4196"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":18,"case_id":"RC96-CH02-03","source_id":"LC6-CH02","source_title":"平码不认人情","source_genre":"古代商贸","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH02_古代商贸_第二章_平码不认人情.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a9f8121456289469e437755ef0b95798e4aa16e4dd104f3467ac98ce8c203b57","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1838,"target_end":1929,"target_sha256":"51785a66efba4b94c34ad01f39e7ad08c5fffc9cabb58349478f99ee79405e2e","target_non_whitespace_character_count":87,"review_class":"FACT_2","reviewed_fact_count":2,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":28,"text":"“你不留我？”\n\n“您三箱手续齐。第四箱手续不齐。”\n\n","text_sha256":"1d9cb0af1187e3c7e5e5d523e7cdb827d9fdf935cdba5b9225e9f0e2ec6f602c"},{"id":"T02","start":28,"end":66,"text":"杜二爷盯了她片刻，忽然又笑起来。他让脚夫抬走三箱，自己却把第四箱留在木架上，","text_sha256":"1c32c5ab7735f31b4e5c1debb4075c025c54435c4ef79e2a548e84d8fb7c42b9"},{"id":"T03","start":66,"end":91,"text":"说等补签。离开前，他拿回那只红封，连客套话也省了。","text_sha256":"7bd0f6e85398eb499232bceabc53b7fde72eb1ff1d36d3f2ac50661915c032ce"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":19,"case_id":"RC96-CH04-02","source_id":"LC6-CH04","source_title":"第四棒不追风","source_genre":"青春竞技","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH04_青春竞技_第四章_第四棒不追风.md","source_chapter_sha256":"e4633301da8d805dbcddea9c8022046254f468bb58b0ba3f016b039039eefe69","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1217,"target_end":1360,"target_sha256":"a01fb465e4ecadf720bb690ff8805d0617a0a12b2c8508e1759f8b9f1767fb26","target_non_whitespace_character_count":140,"review_class":"HARD_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":34,"text":"许乔拿粉笔在地上画了四个歪圈，说每个圈算一个交接区，谁踩线谁请喝水。","text_sha256":"13eb879714c575e179b35257761ee5ddf82f192e1da1d61011d8a94d883b2ba5"},{"id":"T02","start":34,"end":55,"text":"杜航故意把脚悬在线外，问半只鞋算不算。\n\n","text_sha256":"aee05346796885478d8a5007ba2f5166d237f77bad711b252ce6ed6e6413e627"},{"id":"T03","start":55,"end":88,"text":"孟秋蹲下来用手掌把粉线擦粗，三个人就着一条根本不直的白线争了几句。","text_sha256":"7e3444c58bac3c647e924ce5f6c8412dfdd8bdab743b2db48264c11c1ec4717d"},{"id":"T04","start":88,"end":121,"text":"顾驰去器材车借来两枚标志碟，把粉圈压住；风一吹，最轻那枚还是滚了。","text_sha256":"f7f5e4d48c6b0873cf2adb31209a8c58b1eaeb2204fd90e2de9f473cb68d6351"},{"id":"T05","start":121,"end":143,"text":"他们追着塑料碟跑出十几步，又笑着把它踩停。\n","text_sha256":"3461979c626661cdafa6317674ecb320781460294368f9347003b7d3b13f9902"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":20,"case_id":"RC96-CH03-02","source_id":"LC6-CH03","source_title":"一桌席不能少那口锅","source_genre":"乡村家庭","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH03_乡村家庭_第三章_一桌席不能少那口锅.md","source_chapter_sha256":"7e14d3edde53968627b42d92017389d6b3fdb797887baa1589cded954fbe36f0","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2523,"target_end":2587,"target_sha256":"c0321a6db51948545f38850c01c057e0c4e38e5eef966956b79d8b514e3a3925","target_non_whitespace_character_count":64,"review_class":"FACT_2","reviewed_fact_count":2,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":29,"text":"林满仓把这些写在厨房门上，刚贴牢，院外忽然有人喊他的名字。","text_sha256":"6268810998d47ffdb8ae2653cba9cfae7a22f3bb644cd9e82d7236f1413c4dfe"},{"id":"T02","start":29,"end":64,"text":"来的是镇上送液化气的师傅，说村口限高杆坏了，车进不来，明早也未必能送。","text_sha256":"3a2af1fe78757912a60668d3b248065d987622708d2af79c95152308d86b7f00"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":21,"case_id":"RC96-CH06-03","source_id":"LC6-CH06","source_title":"风廊降温失败以后","source_genre":"近未来公共设施","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH06_近未来公共设施_第六章_风廊降温失败以后.md","source_chapter_sha256":"85ce23e513bf972953c6703ef15230b6b629de9f5df044ef16aec30977f1df5b","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1759,"target_end":1901,"target_sha256":"6f27ecfa4e69c718b5ec83e7bd4a1706e0ff7dc3fe802da2e106fc8e06874b47","target_non_whitespace_character_count":140,"review_class":"NATURAL_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":26,"text":"观摩用的折叠椅散在连廊下，椅背上贴着不同单位的纸签。","text_sha256":"9eb8a768dfde6a510aa4a4cff0720861b5793e8b6e1e68c285f2d82d39e96d6e"},{"id":"T02","start":26,"end":54,"text":"志愿者照着纸签归堆，几把椅子贴错了颜色，被搬来搬去。\n\n","text_sha256":"7eccfcb069d1f5f440a9089ab42fad33c0fe2698d34bbe7ed6bf4e28dc04695a"},{"id":"T03","start":54,"end":84,"text":"灰帽老人坚持帮忙，拎起最轻的一把走了两步，又被冯护士接过去。","text_sha256":"e584bbd8c49559958c588a16c10d53600e96ce6cd6453d0ead3d19644712d1bf"},{"id":"T04","start":84,"end":114,"text":"他改去收空碗，把不锈钢碗叠得太高，走到食堂门口时整摞晃起来。","text_sha256":"e348dc43b97a596cf2922a7ae36ad52c8ea3414a580a0f3a3b587c3fb880e5be"},{"id":"T05","start":114,"end":142,"text":"食堂阿姨扶住碗沿，两个人同时说“我来”，谁也没立刻松手。","text_sha256":"fae557313de182df738d278a15accf83417d5dfec8489860d57f453c2f9c4955"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":22,"case_id":"RC96-CH02-04","source_id":"LC6-CH02","source_title":"平码不认人情","source_genre":"古代商贸","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH02_古代商贸_第二章_平码不认人情.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a9f8121456289469e437755ef0b95798e4aa16e4dd104f3467ac98ce8c203b57","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2129,"target_end":2236,"target_sha256":"47fd81477a5cbd3860735abe658bd430b63d0b3c440c5b2c85857d66c74a26ea","target_non_whitespace_character_count":105,"review_class":"FACT_1","reviewed_fact_count":1,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":21,"text":"三个人坐在矮凳上吃，院里只剩偶尔的算盘声。","text_sha256":"d2bc61b39ce7bec693b8eda9c677034bd6b1127322be03bcafe112a6a53e38a9"},{"id":"T02","start":21,"end":56,"text":"阿谷问大砣里的铅是谁挖走的，魏书吏说凭一条缝猜人，是嫌牢饭不够吃。\n\n","text_sha256":"d8c193d689b4910955ab7439f00e661415b8888dc9e2ecea50f49501ce104b50"},{"id":"T03","start":56,"end":83,"text":"阿谷又猜孙掌柜，孙掌柜隔着门咳了一声，他立刻低头喝汤。","text_sha256":"074e032f5b08008733b6dffdba7333038e4e8d38142409ea40c9e205c885d6cb"},{"id":"T04","start":83,"end":107,"text":"沈绫没有参与，只让他们吃完把封存砣送去官牙复验。","text_sha256":"fa5d8184fc61b1c25a00e573505df09cb7a08960a9064a388799829c824393c1"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":23,"case_id":"RC96-CH08-03","source_id":"LC6-CH08","source_title":"云灶今日不卖飞升饼","source_genre":"轻幻想／仙侠日常","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH08_轻幻想日常_第八章_云灶今日不卖飞升饼.md","source_chapter_sha256":"ec940b1ee92f1784bc0fa6036b9b4aa99c8d2c3f808f787c7a0df940ae2572f2","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":862,"target_end":1084,"target_sha256":"1bf15145ae25e56e891148d7cc1f3fc92e32830844d7580dfa25572fc67691eb","target_non_whitespace_character_count":216,"review_class":"HARD_ZERO","reviewed_fact_count":0,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":31,"text":"岑小满往锅里撒盐，郑七娘嫌她手高，盐粒会飞，便把她手腕往下压。","text_sha256":"129e5b97afd423477c684ab8e01963a77d67b29775b4f2e1cd955173db07b7f8"},{"id":"T02","start":31,"end":59,"text":"槐生在旁边削萝卜，皮削得太厚，被罚把厚皮切丝拌小菜。\n\n","text_sha256":"682f177a2473b9122d9bfcf5fb8f701f41606f93cd96c05982ddaa02cd687728"},{"id":"T03","start":59,"end":91,"text":"他切得慢，萝卜丝有的像线，有的像筷子。药圃童子临走前偷拿了一根，","text_sha256":"c95284b6d411e20cda2ffb0304f8ebb4b6166437b6ecc203c183f259b221f2e6"},{"id":"T04","start":91,"end":131,"text":"被郑七娘用勺背敲中手背，只好又放回去。\n\n一只纸鹤从窗缝钻进来，落在面粉缸盖上。","text_sha256":"9b1bae21103e9ca8eeba50e84704c86dab5f5087ceaacada0b25d9d56f08324b"},{"id":"T05","start":131,"end":157,"text":"岑小满以为是西库回信，拆开却只有外门弟子抄的打油诗，","text_sha256":"d849431ffe5a1758d11eab65544c8454150f1e9589cabd875ca0e6c94446bfdf"},{"id":"T06","start":157,"end":190,"text":"第一句便是“云灶一饼冲九霄”。\n\n郑七娘看完没生气，反倒把纸抹平，","text_sha256":"635d969c6156ae6d51135462b12ecec9ebfc1d8f92d1848c8243743eaefa9b80"},{"id":"T07","start":190,"end":222,"text":"垫到摇晃的桌脚下。纸上的“九霄”被桌腿压住，只露出一个“云”字。","text_sha256":"fa83731869a04e7ecc57efe299c02db9f6c9c3c206445cf176c1a879bb1d95c5"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train96-source6-recut24-source-index/2.0","dataset_status":"PASS_CANDIDATE_MODEL_NEUTRAL_GOLD_PENDING_CONTROL_REVIEW","row_index":24,"case_id":"RC96-CH01-04","source_id":"LC6-CH01","source_title":"开市前修好那排棚","source_genre":"现代职场／市井维修","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN96_LONG_CURRICULUM_SOURCE6_20260810_R01/chapters/LC6_CH01_现代市井_第一章_开市前修好那排棚.md","source_chapter_sha256":"fdaad63f91f7f49a57794633b5dba99aa365607f6096f305472889d599db7d29","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2546,"target_end":2743,"target_sha256":"05725cdcc48e6a2a464b88a98a58c6d52ef047dbd9cac332f2c2e5295ae6dc73","target_non_whitespace_character_count":188,"review_class":"FACT_1","reviewed_fact_count":1,"target_units":[{"id":"T01","start":0,"end":34,"text":"“看见我们不一定是坏事。”陈放说。\n\n“那得看你们带没带横梁。”\n\n","text_sha256":"3e82d241c4f2d60df439640172617f09915e4a18553ffb1623114210a6d3f00b"},{"id":"T02","start":34,"end":63,"text":"周遥笑了一声，合上工具箱。菜场里已经是午市的热气，剁肉声、","text_sha256":"1dfc45e372792a05866f1d11ac17aa2b4f21a738a889b5c7056d3ffad5c42804"},{"id":"T03","start":63,"end":100,"text":"收款提示音和摊主的招呼混在一起。她走到西门，回头看见新工牌还挂在陈放胸前，","text_sha256":"0f56dd3b6699430a99c89469df16b0b8baabd9d2a95454d8e9e82e584df83d05"},{"id":"T04","start":100,"end":130,"text":"边角沾了锈粉。\n\n就在这时，菜场南侧传来一阵连续的金属颤响。","text_sha256":"e5699240f14ee74e7770eaaa6aa69debe64f572334d10ccbc1e488ab0b90967f"},{"id":"T05","start":130,"end":159,"text":"不是雨棚，是二楼外置楼梯。几名夜市摊主正把成捆桌板往上搬，","text_sha256":"1fd0734df67a486ff9633ec8012e05c1fa8f840d06d507b2c6b6e0bbbe791d27"},{"id":"T06","start":159,"end":197,"text":"最下面那级踏板随着每一步往下陷。\n\n周遥停住脚，把刚扣好的工具箱重新打开。\n","text_sha256":"415c062a4832f23653b9cfe95e47d1760ab007edea2aea5b9c98867762f781a0"}],"project_original":true,"model_neutral_common_material":true,"training_authorized":false}
